, {airborne V0:airplane C1:segment, is-moving V0:airplane, is-pushing V0:airplane, is-parked V0:airplane C2:segment, airborne V0:airplane C3:segment, is-parked V0:airplane C4:segment}:=1
, {airborne V0:airplane C2:segment, is-moving V0:airplane, is-pushing V0:airplane, is-parked V0:airplane V1:segment, airborne V0:airplane C3:segment}
